eryone%20to%20use.%20You%20are%20also%20welcome%20to%20improve%20Kecare%2C%20meow.%20Star%20and%20PR%20are%20welcome.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Ch3%20id%3D%5C%22fioralune-awards-flower-moon-award%5C%22%3EFioralune%20Awards%20(Flower%20Moon%20Award)%3C%2Fh3%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EThe%20Huayue%20Award%20is%20a%20project%20I%20created%20to%20give%20myself%20an%20award%20(bushi).%20It%26%2339%3Bs%20an%20award%20for%20indie%20developers%2C%20and%20it%20might%20take%20a%20long%20time%20to%20launch%20because%20I%26%2339%3Bm%20so%20lazy.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Ch2%20id%3D%5C%22milkio%5C%22%3EMilkio%3C%2Fh2%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fmilkio.fun%2F%5C%22%3EMilkio%20---%20Milkio%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fakirarika%2Fmilkio%5C%22%3Eakirarika%2Fmilkio%3A%20%F0%9F%8C%9F%20A%20TypeScript%20Framework%20-%20Now%2C%20break%20the%20boundaries%20between%20Frontend%20and%20Backend%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EIt%20is%20a%20TypeScript%20full-stack%20framework%20that%20supports%20Bun%20and%20any%20runtime.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Ch3%20id%3D%5C%22cs-tournament-fioralune-cs2-competition%5C%22%3ECS%20Tournament%20Fioralune%20CS2%20Competition%3C%2Fh3%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3ESimply%20because%20watching%20the%20Xpl%20competition%20was%20so%20terrible%2C%20and%20then%20on%20a%20whim%2C%20I%20came%20up%20with%20this.%20The%20S1%20season%20was%20still%20passable.%20Since%20everyone%20wants%20S2%20so%20much%2C%20let%26%2339%3Bs%20turn%20it%20into%20a%20long-term%20project%20for%20Fioralune.%20The%20prize%20money%20for%20the%20competition%20comes%20from%20everyone%26%2339%3Bs%20sponsorship.%20You%20can%20see%20the%20specific%20prize%20fund%20flow%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fkecare.me%2Fsponsor%2F%5C%22%3EFlower%20Moon%20%C2%B7%20Sponsorship%20-%20Pamper%26%2339%3Bs%20blog%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22isOriginalLang%22%3Afalse%2C%22desc%22%3A%22Fioralune%EF%BC%88%E8%8A%B1%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89%20%E6%88%91%E5%A5%BD%E6%87%92%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E4