o%20separate%20the%20content%20system%20from%20themes%2Fframeworks%2C%20making%20your%20blog%20capabilities%20into%20%5C%22pluggable%20modules%5C%22%20meow~%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FPamperkyumi%2Fkecare)%5Cn%5CnKecare%20is%20a%20static%20website%20generation%20framework%2C%20mainly%20designed%20for%20documentation%20sites%20and%20blogs.%20The%20webpage%20you%20are%20currently%20reading%20was%20processed%20by%20Kecare%2C%20meow.%5Cn%5CnKecare%20has%20probably%20reached%20the%20level%20of%20completeness%20where%20it%20can%20be%20launched%20for%20testing%2C%20meow.%20Later%2C%20I%20will%20improve%20the%20Kecare%20user%20guide%20for%20everyone%20to%20use.%20You%20are%20also%20welcome%20to%20improve%20Kecare%2C%20meow.%20Star%20and%20PR%20are%20welcome.%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%23%20Fioralune%20Awards%20(Flower%20Moon%20Award)%5Cn%5CnThe%20Huayue%20Award%20is%20a%20project%20I%20created%20to%20give%20myself%20an%20award%20(bushi).%20It's%20an%20award%20for%20indie%20developers%2C%20and%20it%20might%20take%20a%20long%20time%20to%20launch%20because%20I'm%20so%20lazy.%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%20Milkio%5Cn%5Cn%5BMilkio%20---%20Milkio%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fmilkio.fun%2F)%5Cn%5Cn%5Bakirarika%2Fmilkio%3A%20%F0%9F%8C%9F%20A%20TypeScript%20Framework%20-%20Now%2C%20break%20the%20boundaries%20between%20Frontend%20and%20Backend%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fakirarika%2Fmilkio)%5Cn%5CnIt%20is%20a%20TypeScript%20full-stack%20framework%20that%20supports%20Bun%20and%20any%20runtime.%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%23%20CS%20Tournament%20Fioralune%20CS2%20Competition%5Cn%5CnSimply%20because%20watching%20the%20Xpl%20competition%20was%20so%20terrible%2C%20and%20then%20on%20a%20whim%2C%20I%20came%20up%20with%20this.%20The%20S1%20season%20was%20still%20passable.%20Since%20everyone%20wants%20S2%20so%20much%2C%20let's%20turn%20it%20into%20a%20long-term%20project%20for%20Fioralune.%20The%20prize%20money%20for%20the%20competition%20comes%20from%20everyone's%20sponsorship.%20You%20can%20see%20the%20specific%20prize%20fund%20flow%20at%20%5BFlower%20Moon%20%C2%B7%20Sponsorship%20-%20Pamper's%20blog%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fkecare.me%2Fsponsor%2F)%22%7D`
